as the competition begins, and one by one, each of the competitors strive to perform their very best in front of the big crowd. Moreover, the current figure skating generation's prodigy, Hikaru Kamisaki, is not competing in this block, which raises everyone's determination to qualify. That includes Inori, who must beat the odds if she wants to keep her promise to reach Hikaru and represent Japan in the Olympics with Tsukasa.\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"],"ja":["メダリスト 第2期",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-73171":"2026-05-25T15:00:32Z","serial-73093":"2026-03-22T19:11:11Z","serial-74696":"2026-04-28T07:07:59Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-73171","serial-73093","serial-74696"],"relatedMalIds":[55318,63326],"rating":8.43,"relations":[{"id":55318,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":63326,"relation":"sequel"}]}]}